  "category" : "Lithium Ion Cell",
  "description" : "The ORION 18650/22 is a popular lithium-ion cell intended for use in high capacity, high voltage 18650 battery packs. It features a nominal capacity of 2200mAh, a nominal voltage of 3.7V, and a maximum pulse discharge current of 11A (5C), making it suitable for a wide range of devices such as electric buffers, smart video doorbells, and fiber optic testers.",
